  "ingredients": [
    "0.667 cup cornstarch",
    "1 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "0.5 teaspoon freshly ground black pepper",
    "1.5 teaspoons kosher salt, divided",
    "3 large eggs, beaten",
    "1.5 pounds boneless skinless chicken breasts, cut into 1 inch pieces",
    "0.25 cup canola or peanut oil",
    "0.75 cup honey",
    "0.5 cup hot pepper sauce (such as Crystal®)",
    "1 tablespoon rice vinegar",
    "0.5 teaspoon crushed red pepper",
    "4 cups cooked white rice",
    "0.5 cup thinly sliced scallions",
    "toasted white sesame seeds, for garnish"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Place a rack in the center of the oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine cornstarch, ginger, pepper, and 1 teaspoon salt in a large bowl. Place beaten eggs in a separate large, shallow bowl. Add chicken to cornstarch mixture and toss to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BFOz6BLPpqFWnkA1G9_asOC9_Gk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/firecracker-chicken-ddmfs-step-1-023-e1f1c0e7e4004046b63dd3f4faf5a8b9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8496389/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 2 tablespoons oil in a large nonstick skillet over medium-high until shimmering.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "While oil is heating, transfer 1/3 of the chicken to dish with eggs and toss to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Caivu7kqZ0tzOFsznWpSCs_T8l8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/firecracker-chicken-ddmfs-step-2-024-51959824f4fa4371a768597a543f788e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8496389/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a slotted spoon to transfer chicken to the hot skillet and cook in hot oil, turning once, until chicken is golden on both sides, about 2 minutes per side (chicken will not be cooked through at this point). Transfer to a 9x13-inch baking dish. Repeat with remaining chicken, adding 1 tablespoon of oil to the skillet per new batch (3 batches total).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uow8qiz05-vBpAXujIPSxNaDGuM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/firecracker-chicken-ddmfs-step-3-025-0e4162cd46594bd8a5541e99f53ad284.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8496389/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together honey, hot sauce, vinegar, crushed red pepper, and remaining 1/2 teaspoon salt in a bowl. Pour over chicken in the baking dish and stir to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N0wB-8kx2QDuKG7Cn4DzETUXEnQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/firecracker-chicken-ddmfs-step-4-031-8ee93f2e230d4bee916399e68c1ce611.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8496389/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, stirring halfway through, 25 to 30 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center of the chicken should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dVTayduEXuc0iYnKg9wvg_Y7jug=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/firecracker-chicken-ddmfs-step-5-049-8dce84e2eba64b139c87e68c6f34f1a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8496389/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve over rice and sprinkle with scallions and sesame seeds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wD_zRDse64V66NvH7JY7B9Isc58=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/firecracker-chicken-ddmfs-3x4-0367-9249e2c65c37445e89e0d9c342be9132.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8496389/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
